  "description": "Cisoo had been rebranded to Vova. The Cisoo K1 Pro Device is now the Vova K2 Pro Device.\n\nThe VOVA K2 Pod Kit may look like the early EGO style vape pens, but this sleek little vape is 100% current!\n\nCompatible with the same VOVA and Cisoo pods as earlier models and maintaining the same sleek, cylindrical design, the K2 Pro kit includes a magnetic sleeve to protect the pre-filled pod. You will also find a type-c port for fast charging to ensure your device is always ready.",
